{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794312379910,"sessionID":"ses_e3ac0b5feffeQB3j67nuyx9vhK","part":{"id":"prt_1c55a1de2001VCDo6lwOt80pMG","messageID":"msg_1c5599da7001XvWqNLbDV8kNVk","sessionID":"ses_e3ac0b5feffeQB3j67nuyx9vhK","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794312379910,"sessionID":"ses_e3ac0b5feffeQB3j67nuyx9vhK","part":{"id":"prt_1c55a1de6001ENlpc9EejE5Wxa","messageID":"msg_1c5599da7001XvWqNLbDV8kNVk","sessionID":"ses_e3ac0b5feffeQB3j67nuyx9vhK","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a weather display app: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` backed by SQLite in `./data`, plus a React/TypeScript/Vite frontend (Tailwind CSS v4) served by the same server on port 8000.\n- Public city lookup (every lookup recorded); signed-in users (Bearer token) manage weather reports. Seeded sample reports for ≥5 cities on first start.\n\n## Important Details\n- Layout: backend at `backend/app.py` (gunicorn `app:app`, `--pythonpath backend`), deps `backend/requirements.txt` + `backend/requirements.lock`; frontend Vite project in `frontend/`, `npm run build` → `frontend/dist`. Dockerfile in workspace root; no Docker available in sandbox — verify locally with gunicorn/python.\n- API contract: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 → `{\"token\": ...}`), `Authorization: Bearer <token>`, 401 without valid token. `GET /api/weather` (params `city`, `page`, `page_size`; paged `{\"items\",\"total\",\"page\",\"page_size\"}`, ordered by city; `city` filter is case-insensitive and records a lookup), `POST /api/weather` (201), `GET/PUT/DELETE /api/weather/{id}` (PUT clears omitted optional fields, sets `observed_at`), `GET /api/weather/recent` (params `limit`; `{\"items\":[{id,city,found,looked_up_at}]}`, newest first), `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- Report shape: `id, city, country, temperature_c, condition, humidity, wind_kph, observed_at`. Cities unique ignoring case. Errors returned as `{\"error\": \"...\"}` with status codes.\n- Key fix: scaffold's `backend/requirements.lock` contains `--hash` lines, which forces pip's `--require-hashes` mode and breaks the Dockerfile's exact install (`pip install -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock`) because `requirements.txt` lacked hashes. Fix: regenerated `backend/requirements.txt` with full hashed pins for all deps (flask, gunicorn, blinker, click, itsdangerous, jinja2, markupsafe, werkzeug) copied from the lock; exact Dockerfile command now succeeds (verified in `/workspace/.scratch/vtest`).\n- Frontend deps installed (exact pins): `tailwindcss`, `@tailwindcss/vite` (deps), `typescript`, `@types/react`, `@types/react-dom` (dev). Tailwind v4 entry `@import \"tailwindcss\";` in `frontend/src/index.css`; avoid hand-written CSS.\n- Frontend behaviors to implement: register/sign-in forms with API error messages, signed-in username + sign-out, city search showing weather card (city, country, temp, condition, humidity, wind, observed) or `No weather data for <city>`, browser-side °C/°F switch, five most recent lookups (click re-searches), signed-in report list with add/edit forms showing API validation messages and delete-after-confirmation.\n- Constraints: no outside services; only package registries reachable; external file writes restricted to `/workspace` (and `/tmp/opencode/*`); scratch dir `/workspace/.scratch` used for venvs/tests; background servers need `setsid ... & disown` (plain `&` hit the 120s shell timeout).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `backend/app.py` fully written: SQLite schema (users, tokens, reports with `city_key` UNIQUE, lookups), seeding of 6 sample cities (London, Paris, Tokyo, New York, Sydney, Berlin), all API endpoints, `app.json.sort_keys = False`, frontend static serving with SPA fallback (`/api/*` → 404 JSON).\n- API smoke-tested end-to-end via curl against a local server: health, paging/order, case-insensitive city search, lookup recording, register (201/409/400), login (200/401), 401 without token, create/replace (optionals cleared)/delete, duplicate city 409, validation 400, recent lookups.\n- `backend/requirements.txt` regenerated with hashed pins; verified `pip install -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock` works.\n- Frontend scaffolding: `frontend/vite.config.ts` (react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy), `frontend/tsconfig.json`, `frontend/src/index.css`, `frontend/src/main.tsx`, `frontend/index.html` (title \"Weather Display\").\n- Frontend modules written: `src/types.ts`, `src/api.ts` (fetch wrapper, `ApiError`, token/username in localStorage), `src/format.ts`, `src/components/WeatherCard.tsx`, `src/components/RecentLookups.tsx`, `src/components/AuthPanel.tsx`, `src/components/ReportManager.tsx` (add/edit forms, delete confirm, paging PAGE_SIZE=10).\n\n### Active\n- Building the React frontend; remaining: root `frontend/src/App.tsx` (still the placeholder `<h1>App</h1>`) wiring together auth state, city search + `No weather data for <city>` message, unit switch (°C/°F), recent lookups (limit 5), and `ReportManager` for signed-in users.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Write `frontend/src/App.tsx` composing `AuthPanel`, search form, `WeatherCard`, unit toggle, `RecentLookups`, and `ReportManager` (report list only when signed in), managing token/username state via `src/api.ts` helpers.\n2. Run `npm run build` (and `npx tsc --noEmit` / `npx tsc -p frontend/tsconfig.json`) in `/workspace/frontend`, fix any TS errors, then verify end-to-end with gunicorn from `/workspace` (`gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app`) checking `GET /api/health`, `/`, and API flows; update `frontend/package-lock.json` is already updated by npm install — confirm nothing else needed.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask app (SQLite store, auth, weather API, seeding, frontend serving) — finished and smoke-tested.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`: regenerated hashed pins; must stay consistent with `backend/requirements.lock`.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `./data` persistent, `frontend/dist` copied next to backend).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: placeholder — next file to write.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`, `types.ts`, `format.ts`: client API/types/formatting helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/`: `WeatherCard.tsx`, `RecentLookups.tsx`, `AuthPanel.tsx`, `ReportManager.tsx` (all written).\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `src/index.css`, `src/main.tsx`, `index.html`: scaffolding (Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`).\n- `/workspace/.scratch/`: test venvs (`vtest`), server logs, scratch data dir (outside deliverable).","time":{"start":1794312379878,"end":1794312379881}}}
